   132	  // Leased FIRST. The barrier must be able to see an invocation that is still mid-drain — one that
   133	  // has receipted nothing yet but still could, under whatever effect set this build carries. A
   134	  // signal written only on completion cannot show that, and a cutover would proceed while an old
   135	  // invocation was still running.
